senses.gloss:
नेपाल नेपाल, अस्, m. (said to be con-
tracted fr. नियम-पाल, q. v., the N. of a sage);
N. of a country, Nepal; a species of sugar-cane;
(आस्), m. pl., N. of the people inhabiting Nepal;
(ई), f. red arsenic; the wild date tree or its fruit;
(अम्), n. copper.
—नेपाल-जा, f. or नेपाल-जाता,
f. red arsenic.
—नेपाल-निम्ब, अस्, m. ‘the Nepal
Nimba,’ a species of tree.
—नेपाल-मूलक, अम्,
n. a radish.
